IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sa-registration`

-- Societies Act 1966, ss 2 to 13 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law.
-- Nothing here has been checked against a decided case, a regulation or an exemption order.
--
-- The twelve-field group fixtures and the eighteen-field Schedule fixtures are generated from a
-- table of which flags are set, so that a typing slip cannot make a case say something other
-- than its name.

§ `Fixtures -- groups`

`a ten-person book club` MEANS GroupFacts WITH
    `is a club, company, partnership or association` IS TRUE
    `the number of persons` IS 10
    `is a company registered under company law` IS FALSE
    `is a company or association constituted under a written law` IS FALSE
    `is a limited liability partnership registered under the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005` IS FALSE
    `is a trade union registered or required to be registered` IS FALSE
    `is a platform work association registered or required to be registered` IS FALSE
    `is a cooperative society registered as such` IS FALSE
    `is a mutual benefit organisation registered as such` IS FALSE
    `was formed for the sole purpose of carrying on a lawful business with the object of gain` IS FALSE
    `is a class, society or association of foreign insurers under a foreign insurer scheme` IS FALSE
    `is a school or the management committee of a school` IS FALSE

