§ `Fixtures -- the Schedule`

`an ordinary hiking club` MEANS SpecifiedFacts WITH
    `purpose touches religion, an ethnic group, a clan, a nationality, or a class by gender or sexual orientation` IS FALSE
    `is a political association` IS FALSE
    `name uses the word National` IS FALSE
    `name uses the word Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the word Singapore only indicates the place of registration` IS FALSE
    `purpose touches a civil or political right` IS FALSE
    `purpose touches the governance of the Singapore society` IS FALSE
    `purpose touches the use or status of a language` IS FALSE
    `formed under the instruction of a foreign government or an affiliated organisation` IS FALSE
    `formed under the instruction of, or affiliated to, a foreign organisation, or mainly funded from outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `it is the Rotaract Club, the Rotary Club, the Toastmasters Club or the Lions Club` IS FALSE
    `is the alumni of an educational institution not established in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `has an office bearer who was an officer of a society dissolved under section 24 less than 3 years ago` IS FALSE
    `has an office bearer convicted, as a member of a society, of an offence involving unlawful expenditure of its funds` IS FALSE
    `has an office bearer previously declared unfit in writing by the Minister` IS FALSE
    `purpose touches pugilistic or martial arts` IS FALSE
    `purpose touches controlled drugs, games of chance, betting, lotteries or sexual services for reward` IS FALSE
    `purpose is to commit or promote an offence` IS FALSE

