§ `Section 10 -- information`

GIVEN `society failed` IS A BOOLEAN, `an officer or manager in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN, `was served` IS A BOOLEAN, `establishes due diligence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN OrderFacts
DECIDE `an order situation` `society failed` `an officer or manager in Singapore` `was served` `establishes due diligence` IS
    OrderFacts WITH
        `the society failed to comply with the whole or part of the order` IS `society failed`
        `this person is an officer or a person managing or assisting in the management in Singapore` IS `an officer or manager in Singapore`
        `this person was served with the order` IS `was served`
        `this person establishes due diligence and that non-compliance was for reasons beyond their control` IS `establishes due diligence`

#ASSERT `the person commits the offence in section 10(3)` (`an order situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- Each of the persons served is separately liable; the defence is theirs to establish.
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 10(3)` (`an order situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 10(3)` (`an order situation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 10(3)` (`an order situation` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 10(3)` (`an order situation` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

GIVEN `altered or destroyed` IS A BOOLEAN, `false statement` IS A BOOLEAN, `knew or reckless` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A FalseResponseFacts
DECIDE `a response` `altered or destroyed` `false statement` `knew or reckless` IS
    FalseResponseFacts WITH
        `intentionally altered, suppressed or destroyed something required by the order` IS `altered or destroyed`
        `made a statement in response that is false or misleading in a material particular` IS `false statement`
        `knew, ought reasonably to have known, or was reckless as to whether it was false or misleading` IS `knew or reckless`

#ASSERT `the person commits the offence in section 10(4)` (`a response` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person commits the offence in section 10(4)` (`a response` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 10(4)` (`a response` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 10(4)` (`a response` FALSE FALSE FALSE)

§ `Sections 11 and 11A -- changing a name or rules`

GIVEN `changed` IS A BOOLEAN, `approved` IS A BOOLEAN, `an officer` IS A BOOLEAN, `had no part` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A ChangeFacts
DECIDE `a change` `changed` `approved` `an officer` `had no part` IS
    ChangeFacts WITH
        `the society changed its name or amended its rules` IS `changed`
        `the Registrar or an Assistant Registrar gave prior approval in writing` IS `approved`
        `this person is an officer of the society` IS `an officer`
        `this person had no part in the decision` IS `had no part`

#ASSERT `the society and this officer commit the offence in section 11(2)` (`a change` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)

-- An officer who had no say in the decision is liable all the same, and there is no due-diligence defence.
#ASSERT `the society and this officer commit the offence in section 11(2)` (`a change` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `an officer charged under section 11(2) has a due-diligence defence`
#ASSERT NOT `the society and this officer commit the offence in section 11(2)` (`a change` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the society and this officer commit the offence in section 11(2)` (`a change` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the society and this officer commit the offence in section 11(2)` (`a change` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

GIVEN `registered under 4A` IS A BOOLEAN, `notice given` IS A BOOLEAN, `failed to comply` IS A BOOLEAN, `an officer` IS A BOOLEAN, `establishes due diligence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NoticeFacts
DECIDE `a notice situation` `registered under 4A` `notice given` `failed to comply` `an officer` `establishes due diligence` IS
    NoticeFacts WITH
        `the society is registered under section 4A` IS `registered under 4A`
        `a written notice was given under section 11A` IS `notice given`
        `the society failed to comply with it` IS `failed to comply`
        `this person is an officer of the society` IS `an officer`
        `this person establishes due diligence and that non-compliance was for reasons beyond their control` IS `establishes due diligence`

#ASSERT `the society commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `this officer commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- The s 11A officer has the defence the s 11(2) officer lacks.
#ASSERT `the society commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `this officer commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the society commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the society commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `this officer commits the offence in section 11A(4)` (`a notice situation` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)

§ `Section 12 -- who may not act as an officer`

GIVEN `convicted of unlawful expenditure` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `convicted of something else` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `declared unfit by the Registrar` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `Minister permitted` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `acting as an officer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN OfficerFacts
DECIDE `an officer candidate` `convicted of unlawful expenditure` `convicted of something else` `declared unfit by the Registrar` `Minister permitted` `acting as an officer` IS
    OfficerFacts WITH
        `convicted, while a member of a society, of an offence involving unlawful expenditure of its funds` IS `convicted of unlawful expenditure`
        `convicted of some other criminal offence` IS `convicted of something else`
        `declared in writing by the Registrar to be unfit by reason of that other conviction` IS `declared unfit by the Registrar`
        `the Minister has granted permission` IS `Minister permitted`
        `acting as an officer of a registered society or a branch` IS `acting as an officer`

-- Limb (a) works on the conviction alone; limb (b) needs the Registrar's written declaration.
#ASSERT `the person is prohibited from acting as an officer` (`an officer candidate` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is prohibited from acting as an officer` (`an officer candidate` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the person is prohibited from acting as an officer` (`an officer candidate` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person is prohibited from acting as an officer` (`an officer candidate` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)

#ASSERT `the person commits the offence in section 12(2)` (`an officer candidate` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 12(2)` (`an officer candidate` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 12(2)` (`an officer candidate` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the person commits the offence in section 12(2)` (`an officer candidate` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)

